steps.llm_prompt:
Format this note as a clean, readable canvas page.

NOTE CONTENT:
${content}

METADATA:
- Date: ${date_formatted}
- Time: ${timestamp}
- Memory ID: ${memory_id}

Create a well-formatted markdown note with:
1. A clear title based on the note content
2. The note content, formatted nicely
3. Any action items or key points highlighted
4. A footer with the timestamp

Keep it concise and scannable.
